-- ============================================================================
-- 6 Degrees — school reference data
--
-- Source: the two school lists published by International Schools Review.
-- ISR gives COUNTRY + SCHOOL NAME only and never states the city, so city is
-- inferred and city_source records how far to trust each row:
--   'name'                  city read verbatim from the school name
--   'fuzzy'                 near-miss spelling recovered (ISR's 'Durress' -> Durres)
--   'fallback-largest-city' A GUESS. The name revealed nothing.
--   'manual'                pinned by hand; city not in doubt
-- Coordinates are GeoNames CITY centroids, not school addresses.
-- ============================================================================

on conflict (name, country) do nothing;
